// example/src/sodium.zen
// the zen-side binding build.zen's `libsodium` target names. `libs:
// ["sodium"]` and `paths:` say what to link and where; THIS file says
// what the library offers, in zen types.
//
// The declarations are left OUT rather than written broken, the same
// choice main.zen makes for std.actor: there is no way to declare a
// foreign function yet — the ffi surface is stage 5 in docs/PLAN.md —
// so a body here would be a preview, and nothing in this directory is.
// With it, this file holds:
//
//     randombytes_buf* = (buf: [u8]) ()
//     crypto_generichash* = (out :: [u8], in: [u8]) i32
